  "adaptations": [
    "Cargo manifest uses pinned external dependencies and lean default features.",
    "WM fonts use named dependency resources.",
    "OctoSense owns app registration, state paths, and opt-in startup behavior.",
    "Catalog rows name the pinned Makepad revision rather than a filesystem location, resolving through the checkout Cargo fetches from GitHub; no sibling checkout is required and those apps build into OctoSense's own tree instead of Cargo's cache.",
    "Omarchy's default Tokyo Night wallpaper is embedded for offline startup; installed wallpapers take precedence and explicit downloads remain available. Asset provenance is recorded in resources/wallpapers/README.md.",
    "User-facing branding is OctoSense; wire protocol identifiers remain compatible.",
    "Client lifecycle reports failed builds and synchronously terminates/reaps process groups on host shutdown.",
    "Run-view widget geometry follows the presented surface after its startup background disappears.",
